  howItWorks: "Heats a working fluid to produce steam. Accepts ANY Liquid_Aqueous
    as the medium and ANY Combustible_* as fuel. Pure water boils efficiently. Milk
    works \u2014 barely; the fats burn first, the water boils second, the curds clog
    the outlet. Producing power from milk is the canonical 'weird path' synergy.
    Steam pipes downstream to a Steam Generator."
